 ('arc-label-context','上端の丸い対象窓と、細い下の操作面を分けて見せる。','${--wb-bg:#263c4b;--wb-accent:#b2ced6;--wb-line:#789fae;--wb-muted:#a2bdca}$ .wb-context-target{background:#2b4656;border:2px solid #85a6b0;border-radius:30px 30px 3px 3px;padding:25px}$ .wb-context-object{background:#5c8391;border-radius:40% 40% 2px 2px;border:1px solid #b1cbcd;box-shadow:inset 0 2px #e2efdc33}$ .wb-context-panel{background:#234453;border:2px solid #8aabb6;border-radius:20px 20px 3px 3px;padding:13px 9px}$ .wb-context-items button{border-radius:2px;border-bottom:1px solid #7fabb388;padding:12px 10px;min-height:45px}$ .wb-menu-glyph{border:1px solid #a1c4c7;border-radius:50% 50% 2px 2px;background:#4f7e89;padding:4px;width:24px}', 'A'),
